只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Unified static-image generation router for DeepSeek Harness: one image_generate tool with standard parameters, config-driven engine routing (OpenAI Images, Zhipu CogView, any compatible endpoint) with health-aware fallback, durable workspace attachments and per-session quota acco","id":"gh:1336221213","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-draw","slug":"PerryLink/dsh-draw","topics":["ai-agent","ai-agents","cogview","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","image-generation","openai-images","text-to-image","zhipu"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Unified static-image generation router for DeepSeek Harness: one image_generate tool with standard p"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"arameters, config-driven engine routing (OpenAI Images, Zhipu CogView, any compatible endpoint) with"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" health-aware fallback, durable workspace attachments and per-session quota acco"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-draw"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Unified static-image generation routing for DeepSeek Harness.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"One tool, many engines — health-aware fallback, durable results, counted usage."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"简体中文 · Español · Português · हिन्दी"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> 🧊 **FROZEN since 2026-10-05** — only real breakages are fixed. The ecosystem has converged on a mo"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"re widely adopted implementation, recorded below."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Community plugin, not affiliated with DeepSeek. Canonical repository: <https://github.com/PerryLink/"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"dsh-draw> (Gitee is a mirror)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install & uninstall"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **git channel** (latest `main`): `dsh plugin --profile web add github:PerryLink/dsh-draw` — the `p"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"repare` script builds with production dependencies only.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## What is dsh-draw?"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Unified static-image generation routing for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"One tool, many engines — health-aware fallback, durable results, counted usage."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"*Structure: the tool and the card's regenerate converge on one drawer — validate → `checkQuotaGenera"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"tions` (before engine spend) → the engine chain with cooldown health → `checkQuotaBytes` (before sto"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"rage) → durable attachment refs plus a gated `draw/generated` event. The dashed return is regenerate"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" re-entering the same path, so it cannot skip quota, routing, storage or audit. The examples below u"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"se the real command surface.*"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Surface | Status |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Harness | DeepSeek Harness `dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.1` (compat declared for `0.1.5-rc.2`) |\n| Node | `^22"},{"id":"p17s2","text":".19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` |\n| Engines | Any OpenAI-compatible images endpoint; presets for OpenAI Images "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"(`gpt-image-1`) and Zhipu CogView (`cogview-3-flash`) |\n| Surfaces | Host `image_generate` tool + we"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"b result card + Plugins settings tab |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The browser half rides the cordis `Context` and the published client packages (`dsh-client-ui-slots`"},{"id":"p18s2","text":", `dsh-client-ui-settings`, `dsh-client-ui-tool`, `dsh-client-locale`, `dsh-client-connection`); it "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"no longer depends on the removed `dsh-client-runtime` package (the tool-call block is read through a"},{"id":"p18s4","text":" local structural contract), so the client surface also lines up with `0.1.2-rc.1` hosts.\n0.1.2-rc.1"},{"id":"p18s5","text":" (adapted 2026-09-02): the session envelope keeps its ignorable field for stored-log read compatibil"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ity only - Session.append still cannot stamp it, so audit-gate behavior is unchanged. Verified 2026-"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"09-06 against the dsh-v0.1.7-alpha.1 master checkout (full gate chain + profile install smoke).\n0.1."},{"id":"p18s8","text":"6-alpha.2 (adapted 2026-09-18): `Session.append`'s third parameter exists only for surface-eligible "},{"id":"p18s9","text":"event types and is a `SurfaceIntent`, never an `ignorable` envelope, so `draw/generated` (a non-surf"},{"id":"p18s10","text":"ace type) is still not written on this line — quota is counted in memory per session and resets when"},{"id":"p18s11","text":" the session restarts, exactly as the \"Quota durability\" note below describes. Verified 2026-09-18 ("},{"id":"p18s12","text":"dual typecheck rulers + the full suite + self-contained/artifacts/readme gates).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`dsh-draw` gives the harness one unified `image_generate` tool with standard parameters (`prompt`/`s"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ize`/`count`/`quality`/`style`/`engine`) that are translated per engine:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Multi-engine routing** — a config-driven chain (OpenAI Images, Zhipu CogView, or any OpenAI-comp"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"atible endpoint) walked top-down with **health-aware fallback**: consecutive failures push an engine"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" into cooldown, and the next healthy engine serves the call.\n- **Durable results** — generated image"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"s are saved as workspace attachments (content-addressed, under the harness's attachment policy) and "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"returned as canonical file references.\n- **Quota accounting** — per-session caps on generation calls"},{"id":"p21s6","text":" and image bytes, folded from the durable session log and enforced before engine spend and before st"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"orage.\n- **Credentials as references** — engine API keys are environment-variable names resolved per"},{"id":"p21s8","text":" call through the official `ctx.credentials` seam; literal keys are never stored in configuration an"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"d never logged.\n- **Web surfaces** — an in-conversation result card (images, engine, quota, one-clic"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"k regenerate) and a Plugins settings tab (engine chain, credential status, probes, quota limits)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Security boundaries"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Credential references, never literals.** `apiKeyRef` names an environment variable; a `baseUrl` "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"embedding credentials fails the load loudly.\n- **Sanitized display.** URLs, probe notes, and error t"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ext are redacted (userinfo passwords, credential query values, bearer tokens, JWTs) before any displ"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ay or log.\n- **Quota before spend.** Generation and byte caps are checked before engine calls and be"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"fore attachment storage; exhausted sessions fail fast without spending engine credits.\n- **Fail loud"},{"id":"p24s6","text":", fall back deliberately.** Malformed responses surface as structured errors; a failing engine is sk"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"ipped after its cooldown threshold, and a fully exhausted chain returns the complete attempt record "},{"id":"p24s8","text":"instead of pretending success."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Image models only.** No video, audio, or edit endpoints; no vision understanding.\n- **Engine com"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"patibility.** Three vocabularies are supported through the provider seam: `openai` (the `POST /image"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"s/generations` shape), `replicate` (prediction create + poll), and `fal` (the `fal.run` queue). Prov"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ider-specific extras beyond `prompt`/size/count (e.g. seed, scheduler) are out of scope.\n- **Cost aw"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"areness is structural.** The plugin counts calls and bytes but does not know engine pricing — pair w"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ith `dsh-budget` for cost governance.\n- **Quota durability on rc.6/rc.7, 0.1.2-rc.1 and 0.1.6-alpha."},{"id":"p26s7","text":"2.** On hosts whose session log cannot carry `draw/generated` (static event whitelist, no `ignorable"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"` envelope; `0.1.2-rc.1` cannot stamp the marker and fails closed on unknown event types at read; on"},{"id":"p26s9","text":" `0.1.6-alpha.2` the append's third parameter is a `SurfaceIntent` for surface types only, so a non-"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"surface event cannot be marked), quota stays exact for the live session from the in-memory fallback "},{"id":"p26s11","text":"ledger but resets on restart; durable accounting resumes on hosts with a plugin event surface. The f"},{"id":"p26s12","text":"irst refused commit warns once, so a degraded session is visible instead of silent."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
